987,64,107,24],[30354,30.2,1987,69,107,21],[30355,25.1,1987,67,109,16]],"links":[["Adams County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/idaho/adams-county"],["ARC or PLC in Adams County","/arc-plc/idaho/adams-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids runs 75 years from 1951, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 39% of normal in April to May and 35% in May to June. So far in 2026 it shows 67% of normal for May to June. Grid 29454 had its driest year in 2013 at 64%.</p>"}
